---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Stay
permalink: /stay/
description: "Where to stay for the wedding: our room blocks at three Brunswick hotels, plus waterfront motels and inns on Bailey Island and cottage rentals around Harpswell."
---
{#- Republished 2026-07-16 (Patrick): general lodging info for now — verified hotels
    around Harpswell and Brunswick. The Harpswell Inn itself is deliberately NOT
    listed (Carolyn, 2026-08-02: guests staying there will be told directly).
    Room blocks (Carolyn, 2026-09-24) lead the page right after the shuttle note;
    the per-guest room-block view (sign-in) can still layer on later. Source data:
    docs/data-lodging.md. -#}
<section class="section section--scene" style="--scene:var(--scene-lookout)">
  <div class="wrap center stack">
    <span class="label eyebrow">Where to stay</span>
    <h1>A place to rest your head</h1>
    <p class="lead">Our room blocks at three hotels in Brunswick, plus a few more options from the water's edge to town.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--cream">
  <div class="wrap">
    {#- Shuttle note per Carolyn (2026-08-22): leads the page so guests read it
        before picking a hotel. Same facts echoed on Travel + FAQ. -#}
    <div class="card" style="max-width:720px; margin:0 auto 28px">
      <h3>Shuttles &amp; parking</h3>
      <p>{{ site.stayNote }}</p>
      <p><strong>{{ site.parkingLot.name }}</strong>, {{ site.parkingLot.address }}. {{ site.parkingLot.directions }}</p>
      {% include "partials/parking-pins.njk" %}
    </div>

    <div class="center" style="max-width:720px; margin:56px auto 28px">
      <h2>Our room blocks</h2>
      <p>{{ site.roomBlocks.intro }}</p>
      <p style="margin:0">{{ site.roomBlocks.overflow }}</p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid--3">
      {% for h in site.roomBlocks.hotels %}
      <div class="card">
        <h3>{{ h.name }}</h3>
        <p class="block-where">{{ h.where }}</p>
        <dl class="facts">
          <div><dt>Block rate, tax included</dt><dd>{{ h.rate }}</dd></div>
          <div><dt>Minimum stay</dt><dd>{{ h.minStay }}</dd></div>
          <div><dt>To cancel</dt><dd>{{ h.cancel }}</dd></div>
          {% if h.bookBy %}<div><dt>Deadline</dt><dd>{{ h.bookBy }}</dd></div>{% endif %}
        </dl>
        <p>{{ h.note }}</p>
        <div class="block-book">
          <p style="margin:0 0 10px">Call and ask for the <strong>Harris/Moore Wedding</strong> block.</p>
          <p style="margin:0 0 10px"><a class="btn btn--ink" href="tel:{{ h.phone | replace('(','') | replace(')','') | replace(' ','') | replace('-','') }}">Call {{ h.phone }}</a></p>
          <p style="margin:0"><a href="{{ h.url }}" rel="noopener">Their site &rarr;</a></p>
        </div>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>

    <div class="center" style="margin:64px 0 28px">
      <h2>More places to stay</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid--2">
      {% for s in site.stay %}
      <div class="card">
        <h3>{{ s.name }}</h3>
        <p>{{ s.note }}</p>
        {% if s.phone %}<p style="margin:0 0 8px"><a class="btn btn--ink" href="tel:{{ s.phone | replace('(','') | replace(')','') | replace(' ','') | replace('-','') }}">Call {{ s.phone }}</a></p>{% endif %}
        {% if s.url and s.url != '#' %}<p style="margin:0"><a href="{{ s.url }}" rel="noopener">Their site &rarr;</a></p>{% endif %}
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    <p class="note center" style="margin-top:28px">August books up early out here, so grab a room once you know you're coming.</p>
  </div>
</section>
